(7668104, 1250745, 4008, '<td valign="top">I see cars so it meets the challenge, but I am missing some sort of focal point or story. There is a lot going on, two cars, a lots of reflections of buildings and a tree, a yellow jacket drawing attention, a person walking by. Leading lines in the composition are towards the person, but he is just passing by, seems to be a coincidence. Not sure where to look.</td>', 'I see cars so it meets the challenge, but I am missing some sort of focal point or story. There is a lot going on, two cars, a lots of reflections of buildings and a tree, a yellow jacket drawing attention, a person walking by. Leading lines in the composition are towards the person, but he is just passing by, seems to be a coincidence. Not sure where to look.', '2020-06-28 12:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
