(7668311, 1250753, 147314, '<td valign="top">So doesn''t look Lamborghini, could be any SUV. Nice to have one in this challenge. I like that the colours in the background match the car.</td>', 'So doesn''t look Lamborghini, could be any SUV. Nice to have one in this challenge. I like that the colours in the background match the car.', '2020-06-30 12:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
